  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n√{(a)/(b)}=(8)/(3)-√{(b)/(a)} and a - b = 10\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a + b)² = a² + b² + 2ab\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n√{(a)/(b)}=(8)/(3)-√{(b)/(a)}\n\n⇒ {√(a)/(b) + √{(b)/(a)} = (8)/(3)}\n\nSquares of both sides\n\n⇒ a/b + b/a + 2(√a/b × √b/a) = 64/9\n\n⇒ a/b + b/a + 2 = 64/9\n\n⇒ a² + b² / ab = 46/9\n\n⇒ {(a - b)² + 2ab} / ab = 46/9\n\n⇒ 100/ ab + 2 = 46 / 9\n\n⇒ 100 /ab = 28/9\n\n⇒ ab = 225/7 \n\n= 32(1)/(7)\n\n**∴ The correct option is 1**\n\nf9:T8d0,\n&",
